                <pb facs="0124" n="4" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg4"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Meyer to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-01-14"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">January 14,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(In answer to telegram of the 13th instant Mr. Meyer reports that the acting
                    minister for foreign affairs, Mr. Fusinato, assures him that the Italian
                    Government is in entire accord with the policy of the United States of
                    maintaining the integrity of China and the open door in the Orient.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
